<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>大多数美国人对运动队中的跨性别运动员与出生性别不符感到不舒服</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/11/most-americans-are-uncomfortable-with-transgender-athletes-on-sports-teams-that-dont-match-their-birth-sex/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.11_transgender_topic.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大多数美国人对变性运动员参加与出生性别不符的球队比赛感到不舒服。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 12:42:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/11/most-americans-are-uncomfortable-with-transgender-athletes-on-sports-teams-that-dont-match-their-birth-sex/</guid></item><item><title>大多数美国人赞成对被判谋杀罪的人判处死刑</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/08/06/most-americans-favor-the-death-penalty-for-those-convicted-of-murder/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/pp_2026-8-6_death-penalty_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;虽然 68% 的人认为对谋杀犯判处死刑在道德上是合理的，但 59% 的人表示死刑并不能阻止严重犯罪——而且在这两个问题上都存在巨大的党派分歧。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/08/06/most-americans-favor-the-death-penalty-for-those-convicted-of-murder/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的工作支持率低于历史标准</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/trumps-job-approval-rating-is-low-by-historical-standards/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.06_historic-ratings_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;特朗普的工作支持率为 34%，低于历任总统的同等水平，党派差距达 78 个百分点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/trumps-job-approval-rating-is-low-by-historical-standards/</guid></item><item><title>自 1990 年以来任命的大多数美国参议员都通过竞选来保住自己的席位，而且大多数都获胜了</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/most-us-senators-appointed-since-1990-have-run-to-keep-their-seat-and-most-have-won/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.06_senate_appt_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;自1990年以来，美国参议院已任命了43名议员，其中27名（63%）通过竞选保住了席位。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/06/most-us-senators-appointed-since-1990-have-run-to-keep-their-seat-and-most-have-won/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对中期选举的公正性和准确性有多少信心？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.05_midterm_voting_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;超过一半的美国人相信 2026 年中期选举将是公平的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 13:30:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</guid></item></channel></rss>